<para>Must be called before <ref refid="class_marmot_state_layout_dynamic_1a1248d8cd857f4a9d24ed02f8a968769b" kindref="member">finalize()</ref>. Adding a variable with an already-registered name or calling this method after <ref refid="class_marmot_state_layout_dynamic_1a1248d8cd857f4a9d24ed02f8a968769b" kindref="member">finalize()</ref> throws <computeroutput>std::runtime_error</computeroutput>.</para>
