        <name>finalize</name>
        <qualifiedname>MarmotStateLayoutDynamic::finalize</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Compute and lock the offsets of all registered variables. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Iterates over the registered variables in registration order, assigns each a contiguous offset, and sets the total size. After this call no further variables may be added. Calling <ref refid="class_marmot_state_layout_dynamic_1a1248d8cd857f4a9d24ed02f8a968769b" kindref="member">finalize()</ref> a second time throws <computeroutput>std::runtime_error</computeroutput>. </para>
