    <briefdescription>
<para>Runtime-defined layout for a flat array of named <computeroutput>double</computeroutput> state variables. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Variables are registered by name and size via <ref refid="class_marmot_state_layout_dynamic_1a6cabfe5343f86e2621d22d9ee8f313d3" kindref="member">add()</ref>, then the layout is locked with <ref refid="class_marmot_state_layout_dynamic_1a1248d8cd857f4a9d24ed02f8a968769b" kindref="member">finalize()</ref>, which assigns contiguous offsets. After finalization the various <computeroutput>get*</computeroutput> accessors can be used to reach individual variables inside any conforming state vector. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
